LAN: jue 8 · 14:00  Abrir en Google Maps<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=34.646306,135.513309">Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.513309,34.646306,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>⭐ Parque Tennōji + Keitakuen</name><styleUrl>#k_site</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Parque urbano con el jardín japonés Keitakuen al centro: estanque, pinos podados y silencio — un respiro entre Shinsekai y Abeno. — EN EL PLAN: jue 8 · 11:10  Abrir en Google Maps<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=34.649657,135.511583">Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.511583,34.649657,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>🍜 Yaekatsu</name><styleUrl>#resto_Take</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Kushikatsu de Shinsekai, favorito de locales · ¥1,600 · Nivel 🎋 Take — días: jue 8  Abrir en Google Maps<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=34.649697,135.506015">Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.506015,34.649697,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>🍜 Kushikatsu Tengu</name><styleUrl>#resto_Take</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Kushikatsu clásico del barrio retro · ¥1,800 · Nivel 🎋 Take — días: jue 8  Abrir en Google Maps<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=34.651643,135.506058">Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.506058,34.651643,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>🍜 Daruma (original 1929)</name><styleUrl>#resto_Take</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[La casa madre del kushikatsu, donde nació · ¥2,000 · Nivel 🎋 Take — días: jue 8  Abrir en Google Maps<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=34.651570,135.506203">Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.506203,34.651570,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>🍜 Matsusakagyu M Namba</name><styleUrl>#resto_Ai</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Yakiniku Matsus